parameters.text:
=You are a top short-form video scriptwriter. Write one {{ $json.platform }} script.

Topic: {{ $json.topic }}
Audience: {{ $json.audience || 'general' }}
Length: {{ $json.length_seconds }} seconds
Tone: {{ $json.tone || 'Energetic' }}
Call to action: {{ $json.cta || 'a natural follow or comment prompt' }}
Channel niche: {{ $json.channel_niche }}
Voice: {{ $json.voice_notes }}

Write for the ear: short sentences, one idea per beat, no filler intros ("Hey guys", "In this video").
- Beat 1 (0-3 s) is the hook. It must create curiosity or name a pain in under 12 words.
- Aim for about {{ Math.round((Number($('Set channel voice').first().json.length_seconds) || 30) * (Number($('Set channel voice').first().json.words_per_second) || 2.5)) }} spoken words in total so it fits {{ $('Set channel voice').first().json.length_seconds }} seconds.
- on_screen_text is max 6 words per beat. visual says what to film or show.
- End with the call to action. Give exactly 3 alternative hooks in hooks.
- hashtags: 3-5 specific ones, no generic #fyp spam.
- Never invent statistics, prices or quotes. Avoid these words: {{ $('Set channel voice').first().json.banned_words || 'none' }}.

